{"id":"d0dc2670ffdd2806","group":"91","path":"91/91-fact-theory-comparison.md","title":"fact-theory-comparison — 固定版本的真理理论算术比较","display":"fact-theory-comparison — 固定版本的真理理论算术比较","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-fact-theory-comparison","aliases":["91-fact-theory-comparison"],"display":"fact-theory-comparison — 固定版本的真理理论算术比较","depends_on":["[[91-thm-typed-conservative]]","[[91-thm-CT-conservative]]","[[91-thm-FS-strength]]","[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence]]","[[91-df-truth-strength]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-fact-theory-comparison"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-fact-theory-comparison</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-theory-comparison — 固定版本的真理理论算术比较"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e76f1ecb9ab7743\" href=\"?note=7e76f1ecb9ab7743\" title=\"91-thm-typed-conservative\">91-thm-typed-conservative</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f32c7d95792dcee2\" href=\"?note=f32c7d95792dcee2\" title=\"91-thm-CT-conservative\">91-thm-CT-conservative</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e17f40587f032600\" href=\"?note=e17f40587f032600\" title=\"91-thm-FS-strength\">91-thm-FS-strength</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d84df7f701355c56\" href=\"?note=d84df7f701355c56\" title=\"91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence\">91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为固定基础算术。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为算术后果关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{CT}^{-},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0},\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{CT}^{-},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0},\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span> 采用所引强度定理的固定版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}theory\\text{-}comparison}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{TB})=\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{UTB})=\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{CT}^{-})=\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}theory\\text{-}comparison}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{TB})=\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{UTB})=\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{CT}^{-})=\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{ID}_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{ID}_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>现在直接依赖证明上述比较的定理，所用分层真理和 ID_1 均已有展开定义，避免只引用名称却缺少比较理论。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>真理机制</th>\n<th>归纳版本与算术结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>TB、UTB</td>\n<td>逐句、闭项统一去引号</td>\n<td>完整 PA_T，仍保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span></td>\n<td>基础语言编码的组合句</td>\n<td>仅基础归纳，保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>FSN 加 NEC/CONEC</td>\n<td>完整 PA_T，等强 RT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(_{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td>双向强 Kleene 组合句</td>\n<td>完整 PA_T，等强 RT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VF</td>\n<td>超赋值公理</td>\n<td>完整 PA_T，等强 ID<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_1\">\\(_1\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>上述是算术后果比较。FS 的 ω 不一致性和 KF 固定点的三值性不改变外层公理理论采用的经典逻辑，也不能充当序数数值。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.5、Theorem 8.5、Corollary 14.32、§15.3、第 18 章。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-typed-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"7e76f1ecb9ab7743","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-typed-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-CT-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"f32c7d95792dcee2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-FS-strength","status":"resolved","id":"e17f40587f032600","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-FS-strength]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"d84df7f701355c56","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{CT}^{-},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF},\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega},\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0},\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}theory\\text{-}comparison}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{TB})=\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{UTB})=\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{CT}^{-})=\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{PA}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{ID}_1.","display":true},{"tex":"^-","display":false},{"tex":"_{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"_{<\\varepsilon_0}","display":false},{"tex":"_1","display":false}],"bytes":2141,"backlinks":[{"id":"aa2ad816ed17d60f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8f32f747a261016d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-209","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-fact-theory-comparison]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-209","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-fact-theory-comparison]]"}],"outgoing":["7e76f1ecb9ab7743","f32c7d95792dcee2","e17f40587f032600","d84df7f701355c56","c87db4d1858a0009"]}